<<~ ahu slot=`#/purpose`>>

`LarDiskProjectorOptions` names each construction port: the mirrors, the render shore, the bag stores, the composition readers, the alert rails, the capture door, the congruence doors, the Synced tree and the journal. Types alone; the composer re-exports the name. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/disk-projector-dam`>>) carries its observations.

